<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS PLN 339 MLN OF BONDS AT OUTRIGHT.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS PLN 339 MLN OF BONDS AT OUTRIGHT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell outright 161 million zlotys of 17-percent</p>
<p>two-year bonds, due July 12, 1997, and 178 million zlotys of</p>
<p>14-percent five-year bonds, due July 12, 2000, it said.</p>
<p>The settlement date is August 28 by 0900 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
